{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:32 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:32 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:32 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b530348435b7bb75b9e96f2cd8cd1af7/2026-11/001_19.png\"/><p>青衣發生工業意外。今日（27日）下午4時許，警方接獲報案，指一名70多歲男子於担杆山路88號一船廠工作期間發生意外，救援人員趕至將他救出，發現他手腳骨折，幸仍然清醒，遂把他由救護車送院治療，警方正調查事件。</p><p>據了解，事主為船廠東主，當時他在船廠對開操控小型吊臂，其間疑吊臂零件鬆脫，令一部分吊臂墮下將他擊中。事主連人帶機墮海，更一度被壓住雙腳。</p><img alt=\"事主連人帶機墮海。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4f584247be5eff65e85f62492fdda62/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_18_18_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方到場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8e60d8854d52977892065ddca0d70ca/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_18_18_15_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"吊臂突然折斷，將事主擊中。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ed6dcc979f7639deb026f8e0c836e74/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_18_18_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f5276669c5d95e02ecdd55860bce84e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_18_18_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2dfc8123399e19e000eeb0e2049acb56/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_18_18_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"一名70多歲男工人於船廠工作期間發生意外。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9d53c76d33d89029dd4196e2ebf11c0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_17_43_33.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為担杆山路88號一船廠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8bc244ab642c344a5a239b0f3304be2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_17_43_33_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00cbac1d2940b44a5abe273d8edffd12/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_17_33_45.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae9b77800244b8c106af859082012b03/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_17_33_45_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男工人被救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7df652f4ac4bf7fb057095c59d320e9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_17_33_44.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:44:00.546342+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:32:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T20:57:51.986420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:32.135820+00:00","content_hash":"6d066b348c7f4cd8fdd9db3c517f3b5220a3cbaa9adf082353c6e14ed538b1a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}